[
  {
    "text": "马车在泥泞的道路上颠簸前行，车轮碾过积水的声音在黄昏的旷野中回荡。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "calm",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "wilderness_road_twilight",
    "sfx_cue": "cart_bumping, water_splashing"
  },
  {
    "text": "罗伦斯拉了拉斗篷，挡住从车帘缝隙透进来的冷风。货物还堆在车厢后面，这一趟如果能顺利卖出去，至少够他们在下一个城镇住上几天。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "serious",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": "wind_blowing"
  },
  {
    "text": "喂，咱说汝啊。",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "赫萝",
    "emotion": "mischievous",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "车篷里传来一个慵懒的声音。罗伦斯回头，看到赫萝从麦草堆里探出头来，琥珀色的眼睛在昏暗的车厢里微微发亮。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "calm",
    "emotion_intensity": 1,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": "rustling_straw"
  },
  {
    "text": "又怎么了？",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "罗伦斯",
    "emotion": "tired",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "罗伦斯叹了口气。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "tired",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": "sigh"
  },
  {
    "text": "赫萝眯起眼睛，嘴角微微上扬，露出一个狡黠的笑容。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "mischievous",
    "emotion_intensity": 3,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "汝是不是又在算账了？咱听得见汝叹气的声音。每次汝叹气，就是在算钱的事。",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "赫萝",
    "emotion": "mocking",
    "emotion_intensity": 3,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "罗伦斯无奈地摇摇头。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "helpless",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "我只是想着接下来的路程。天黑之前得赶到镇上。",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "罗伦斯",
    "emotion": "serious",
    "emotion_intensity": 3,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "哼。",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "赫萝",
    "emotion": "proud",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "赫萝缩回麦草堆里，只露出两只耳朵的尖尖。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "calm",
    "emotion_intensity": 1,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": "rustling_straw"
  },
  {
    "text": "咱倒是不急。反正汝又不会把咱扔下。",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "赫萝",
    "emotion": "tender",
    "emotion_intensity": 3,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "她说得没错，罗伦斯知道这一点。但他不会承认的。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "serious",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "远处，教堂的钟声隐约传来。城镇应该不远了。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "hopeful",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "wilderness_road_twilight",
    "sfx_cue": "church_bells_distant"
  },
  {
    "text": "赫萝又探出头来，这次她的表情认真了一些。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "serious",
    "emotion_intensity": 3,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "罗伦斯，咱闻到了水的味道。是河。",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "赫萝",
    "emotion": "serious",
    "emotion_intensity": 3,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": "sniffing"
  },
  {
    "text": "罗伦斯勒住马，侧耳倾听。确实，风里带着一丝湿润的气息，还有远处水车的吱呀声。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "focused",
    "emotion_intensity": 2,
    "scene": "wilderness_road_twilight",
    "sfx_cue": "horse_reins, waterwheel_creaking"
  },
  {
    "text": "你的鼻子还真好使。",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "罗伦斯",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "emotion_intensity": 3,
    "scene": "wilderness_road_twilight",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "咱是狼嘛。",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "赫萝",
    "emotion": "proud",
    "emotion_intensity": 4,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": null
  },
  {
    "text": "赫萝得意地摇了摇尾巴。",
    "type": "narration",
    "speaker": null,
    "emotion": "happy",
    "emotion_intensity": 3,
    "scene": "cart_interior",
    "sfx_cue": "rustling_clothes"
  }
]